1
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:53,280
Zuo Feichen, from now until the banquet ends,

2
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,319
you're in charge of Zone A.

3
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:56,319
Understood. No problem.

4
00:02:22,039 --> 00:02:22,840
Xiao Bei.

5
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,520
Mr. Feng and Anda have left the reception.

6
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,319
They went to the lobby.

7
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:30,439
Keep eyes on them.

8
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,159
Where's Anda?

9
00:02:35,639 --> 00:02:36,879
Just got into Feng Ziwen's car.

10
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,520
Enjoy your meal.

11
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,240
Thank you.

12
00:03:34,159 --> 00:03:36,120
I never thought you'd come to a place like this.

13
00:03:37,639 --> 00:03:38,960
When I was a kid,

14
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:41,960
this place was still called Fuhai Lane.

15
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,520
I don't know when they changed the name.

16
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,280
So the few times I came back,

17
00:03:48,879 --> 00:03:50,479
I could never find it.

18
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,120
It's all thanks to you this time.

19
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:55,319
When I was a kid, on my way to school,

20
00:03:55,319 --> 00:03:56,639
I'd always pass by here.

21
00:03:56,639 --> 00:03:59,080
So when you mentioned Fuhai Lane,

22
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,599
it kind of rang a bell.

23
00:04:03,159 --> 00:04:04,319
Back when I used to come here,

24
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:07,599
this place didn't even have a sign.

25
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:13,319
I thought even if I found the place,

26
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,319
the shop would've been long gone.

27
00:04:15,879 --> 00:04:16,959
I really didn't expect this.

28
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,759
Thank you, Anda.

29
00:04:24,319 --> 00:04:25,120
It's delicious.

30
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:37,279
You missed this place so much,

31
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:39,120
why aren't you eating?

32
00:04:42,279 --> 00:04:43,680
So many years have passed,

33
00:04:45,079 --> 00:04:46,879
I'm just afraid it won't taste the same.

34
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:54,800
Not knowing if the flavor changed,

35
00:04:55,439 --> 00:04:57,720
or if the person eating it has changed.

36
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,800
My biggest...

37
00:05:13,279 --> 00:05:14,680
Why did he follow us here?

38
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:26,079
That's President Xiang's second son from Zhong'an Group.

39
00:05:26,639 --> 00:05:27,680
You know Xiang Bei?

40
00:05:28,839 --> 00:05:29,959
You could say that.

41
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:31,680
Why isn't he coming in?

42
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,720
He's probably afraid of disturbing you.

43
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:46,639
Xiang Bei.

44
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:48,639
Nice to meet you.

45
00:05:48,639 --> 00:05:49,319
Hello.

46
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:51,120
Pull up a chair and have a seat.

47
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:51,439
Okay.

48
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,720
Another bowl of fried rice noodles, please.

49
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,439
Sure thing.

50
00:06:00,439 --> 00:06:02,720
I'm sorry to interrupt your meal, Mr. Feng.

51
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,879
But as the security consultant for the expo,

52
00:06:04,879 --> 00:06:05,959
I'm responsible for everything

53
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:07,319
related to security matters.

54
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:11,120
I've heard your father mention you long ago.

55
00:06:12,279 --> 00:06:14,279
If Anda hadn't called your name just now,

56
00:06:14,279 --> 00:06:15,680
I wouldn't have been sure.

57
00:06:16,399 --> 00:06:18,120
You know my father, Mr. Feng?

58
00:06:18,399 --> 00:06:19,199
Of course.

59
00:06:20,199 --> 00:06:21,519
Our Yashili Jewelry

60
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:24,720
has been Zhong'an's long-term partner.

61
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:30,879
And our group's businesses in many sectors

62
00:06:31,519 --> 00:06:33,600
have worked with President Xiang for years.

63
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:37,399
You're involved in other sectors too, Mr. Feng?

64
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,199
Hengshang Properties.

65
00:06:40,279 --> 00:06:41,720
Come on, eat up.

66
00:06:45,439 --> 00:06:48,120
I know your current situation very well.

67
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:51,279
The rest of the Silent Protectors team has left.

68
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:52,399
You're the only one left.

69
00:06:52,959 --> 00:06:54,720
Under such difficult circumstances,

70
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:57,279
why did you still accept Zhong'an's request?

71
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:03,399
Because I promised President Xiang,

72
00:07:04,279 --> 00:07:05,319
and I promised you.

73
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,319
Phase two of the port will open soon,

74
00:07:09,759 --> 00:07:11,800
and the contractor is Zhonggang.

75
00:07:13,199 --> 00:07:15,879
It'll bring you plenty of opportunities.

76
00:07:16,519 --> 00:07:17,279
That's right.

77
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:19,680
So I'm really looking forward to it.

78
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,120
Once phase two of the port is built,

79
00:07:22,519 --> 00:07:24,959
I'm sure it'll bring me a lot of business.

80
00:07:25,519 --> 00:07:28,199
As President Xiang said, I eat Western food,

81
00:07:28,639 --> 00:07:30,160
but I can eat Chinese food as well.

82
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:36,360
Zhong'an and Bituo will make great partners.

83
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,279
Speaking of which, I should thank you.

84
00:07:41,519 --> 00:07:42,319
Here.

85
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:45,680
Thank you.

86
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,480
You're welcome.

87
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:47,519
We don't need to drain our glasses, right?

88
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,040
Just half.

89
00:07:49,279 --> 00:07:50,600
All right, just half.

90
00:07:54,519 --> 00:07:55,279
Wei Tian.

91
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:57,800
Never thought we'd fight side by side again.

92
00:07:57,879 --> 00:07:58,680
Yeah.

93
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:01,360
It's really been a long time.

94
00:08:02,439 --> 00:08:03,959
I thought after Xiang Bei returned home,

95
00:08:04,439 --> 00:08:07,120
Zhong'an would give up on the security market here.

96
00:08:07,519 --> 00:08:10,120
Didn't expect President Xiang to send you back.

97
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,879
Because this time, Zhonggang Group's

98
00:08:12,879 --> 00:08:14,759
bidding conference in Antilocaris

99
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:15,800
is extremely important.

100
00:08:16,079 --> 00:08:17,560
So I actually received

101
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:18,600
President Xiang's orders

102
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,279
to come here specifically to back you up.

103
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,879
What are your thoughts on this?

104
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,480
As you've seen,

105
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,160
the terrain is very complicated.

106
00:08:26,279 --> 00:08:27,120
First, we must defend against

107
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,519
attacks from the ground.

108
00:08:28,879 --> 00:08:31,680
Then use the terrain to establish a perimeter.

109
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:34,519
We must set up chicanes at every entrance and exit.

110
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,159
Also, our operation this time

111
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:37,720
is completely confidential.

112
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:39,600
As long as no undercover operatives

113
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:41,279
from the anti-government terrorists infiltrate,

114
00:08:41,279 --> 00:08:42,720
there shouldn't be any major issues.

115
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:43,919
Right.

116
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,919
If the bidding conference goes smoothly,

117
00:08:46,919 --> 00:08:47,919
that's a good thing.

118
00:08:48,679 --> 00:08:51,080
But what worries me more is what comes after.

119
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:54,399
Once Zhonggang begins construction,

120
00:08:54,879 --> 00:08:56,559
if anyone sneaks in to sabotage it,

121
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,679
that'll be real trouble.

122
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,320
You've heard about what happened

123
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,519
to Huatie back then, right?

124
00:09:03,799 --> 00:09:04,879
Actually, I know

125
00:09:04,879 --> 00:09:06,759
our mission this time is extremely tough.

126
00:09:06,799 --> 00:09:07,840
We must strictly monitor

127
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,279
everyone coming and going.

128
00:09:09,639 --> 00:09:11,919
Yet we're short on personnel right now.

129
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,080
For us,

130
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:14,960
this task really is very difficult.

131
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,519
Besides, I also heard

132
00:09:18,279 --> 00:09:21,279
you're the only one left in the Silent Protectors.

133
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,120
That's right.

134
00:09:27,039 --> 00:09:28,200
Even if I'm on my own,

135
00:09:28,919 --> 00:09:31,919
I'll give it my all to get the job done.

136
00:09:34,879 --> 00:09:36,720
I don't care who hosted the reception.

137
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,919
I only care about how well you executed it.

138
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:41,919
President Xiang, the opening reception security

139
00:09:41,919 --> 00:09:43,120
went completely smoothly.

140
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:43,960
I wasn't asking you.

141
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:46,519
Reporting, sir.

142
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,600
Nothing out of the ordinary happened yesterday.

143
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,679
Then why did I get a complaint?

144
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:53,759
It said a waiter

145
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:55,879
nearly spilled red wine on a guest,

146
00:09:56,039 --> 00:09:58,080
almost ruining the host's event.

147
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,360
Why aren't you answering?

148
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:03,279
I'll apologize to the client today.

149
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:05,000
No need.

150
00:10:06,919 --> 00:10:08,919
I've decided to pull your team

151
00:10:09,039 --> 00:10:10,240
and have another group replace you.

152
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:10,879
Dad!

153
00:10:11,639 --> 00:10:12,519
Shen Yu spent

154
00:10:12,519 --> 00:10:14,480
three days and nights refining this proposal!

155
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:16,200
You can't just cancel it on a whim!

156
00:10:16,759 --> 00:10:18,720
What are you doing? Stop pulling on him!

157
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,919
Think I'm blind?

158
00:10:21,279 --> 00:10:22,080
Ridiculous.

159
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,000
The proposal is sound,

160
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,399
but the execution is flawed.

161
00:10:29,679 --> 00:10:31,320
Aren't you two still busy with that

162
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,799
Women's Self-Defense class?

163
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:35,080
Stick to that.

164
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,559
Don't worry about anything else.

165
00:10:36,919 --> 00:10:37,720
But...

166
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:40,519
Still refusing to change?

167
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:42,399
I will.

168
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:44,559
That settles it.

169
00:10:45,519 --> 00:10:46,279
Dismissed.

170
00:10:46,279 --> 00:10:46,960
Yes, sir.

171
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,159
Hold on.

172
00:10:51,639 --> 00:10:52,440
The pen.

173
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,120
Are you all right?

174
00:11:12,919 --> 00:11:13,720
I'm fine.

175
00:11:14,519 --> 00:11:15,320
Shen Yu,

176
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:16,799
I know

177
00:11:16,799 --> 00:11:18,759
how much effort you put into that proposal.

178
00:11:18,879 --> 00:11:20,399
But... but my dad...

179
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:21,879
It's all right.

180
00:11:22,279 --> 00:11:24,399
Didn't we do our best on that project?

181
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:26,480
President Xiang is just holding us to high standards.

182
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:29,000
Besides, wasn't the proposal recognized?

183
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,519
It makes no difference who executes it.

184
00:11:30,799 --> 00:11:31,720
Don't take it to heart.

185
00:11:54,279 --> 00:11:56,919
Anda, don't be afraid.

186
00:11:57,679 --> 00:11:58,519
I'll stay with you.

187
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,000
Wei Tian, take care of yourself.

188
00:12:42,039 --> 00:12:44,360
All the proposals submitted

189
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,720
by major port construction companies

190
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:48,080
have undergone detailed analysis and comparison.

191
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:50,080
Furthermore, within each proposal,

192
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,080
the security plan

193
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:53,200
was reviewed by the King and council members

194
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:55,080
through repeated deliberation,

195
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:57,200
along with careful analysis and comparison.

196
00:12:57,279 --> 00:13:00,000
Now it is time to announce the bidding results.

197
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,240
Today's winning bidder

198
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:03,720
will be announced by our special guest.

199
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,639
Let's give a warm round of applause

200
00:13:05,639 --> 00:13:08,000
to welcome His Majesty the King.

201
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:08,720
Please welcome him.

202
00:13:25,879 --> 00:13:27,600
First, I want to thank

203
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:30,559
the construction firms from around the world

204
00:13:30,600 --> 00:13:32,840
who traveled all the way to Supedo

205
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:36,200
to participate in the bidding

206
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:38,919
for Phase II of the Antilocaris pipeline.

207
00:13:39,559 --> 00:13:41,519
I truly wish our country

208
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:44,919
had several oilfields to develop.

209
00:13:45,039 --> 00:13:45,840
Unfortunately,

210
00:13:46,279 --> 00:13:49,080
Antilocaris is currently our only one.

211
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,840
Now, I will announce

212
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:54,879
the winning bidder for the Antilocaris plant.

213
00:13:55,399 --> 00:13:57,120
This construction firm

214
00:13:57,679 --> 00:14:00,919
is well-funded and highly experienced.

215
00:14:01,279 --> 00:14:02,799
What impressed me the most

216
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:05,279
was the security strategy

217
00:14:05,279 --> 00:14:06,960
attached to their proposal.

218
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:07,960
I hereby announce that

219
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:10,720
today's winning bidder

220
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:15,080
is Zhonggang Group from China.

221
00:14:22,559 --> 00:14:24,879
Wei Tian, that wasn't easy at all.

222
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,120
Thank you so much.

223
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,399
I hope our future cooperation

224
00:14:27,399 --> 00:14:28,360
will continue to go

225
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:30,159
just as smoothly as it did today.

226
00:14:30,159 --> 00:14:30,919
Thank you.

227
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,960
Please welcome the representative of the winning firm on stage.

228
00:14:34,279 --> 00:14:35,080
Thank you.

229
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,360
Congratulations.

230
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:00,879
Wei Tian, let me tell you, then you—

231
00:15:02,919 --> 00:15:03,919
What are you doing here?

232
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:06,960
Wait, you're in touch with Wei Tian?

233
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:09,720
No, no, no, it's not him. It's not him.

234
00:15:09,759 --> 00:15:11,120
I heard you.

235
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,960
You've been in contact with Wei Tian this whole time,

236
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,080
and didn't even tell me.

237
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,519
I thought he'd lost contact with everyone,

238
00:15:16,519 --> 00:15:17,679
turns out it was just with me.

239
00:15:17,679 --> 00:15:19,080
You kept lying to me, too!

240
00:15:19,159 --> 00:15:20,200
This is too much!

241
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:20,919
Anda!

242
00:15:20,919 --> 00:15:22,519
Anda! Anda!

243
00:15:27,279 --> 00:15:28,279
How is it over there?

244
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:30,399
The line went dead.

245
00:15:49,799 --> 00:15:52,120
Let me introduce someone to you all.

246
00:15:53,519 --> 00:15:56,480
This is Mr. Hades,

247
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,519
our military advisor.

248
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:06,080
Thank you, everyone. Thank you, General.

249
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:09,639
Please sit.

250
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,399
King Jose Limon

251
00:16:15,279 --> 00:16:17,480
has awarded Phase II of the oil pipeline project

252
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:19,759
to a foreign company.

253
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:22,320
To the people of Supedo,

254
00:16:22,519 --> 00:16:24,000
this is an outright insult.

255
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:26,440
Moreover, the reforms he is pushing

256
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:29,000
have severely infringed upon our interests.

257
00:16:30,879 --> 00:16:33,320
We must take action

258
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:34,919
to defend what is ours.

259
00:16:34,919 --> 00:16:35,559
Yes, sir.

260
00:16:44,519 --> 00:16:45,320
Who is it?

261
00:16:46,919 --> 00:16:47,720
Auntie.

262
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:50,159
Xiang Bei.

263
00:16:52,039 --> 00:16:53,960
Xiang Bei, you're just in time.

264
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:56,519
She went straight to bed the moment she got back.

265
00:16:56,639 --> 00:16:57,919
She won't get up no matter what.

266
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,960
I've called her for dinner several times already.

267
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,279
Whatever it is,

268
00:17:01,279 --> 00:17:03,279
talk it through and don't fight.

269
00:17:03,279 --> 00:17:04,079
Okay.

270
00:17:06,319 --> 00:17:07,119
Anda.

271
00:17:08,359 --> 00:17:09,759
I'm heading to the supermarket.

272
00:17:10,279 --> 00:17:11,519
Xiang Bei is here.

273
00:17:13,039 --> 00:17:14,119
Have a good talk.

274
00:17:15,599 --> 00:17:16,400
Go on.

275
00:17:25,079 --> 00:17:27,079
Anda, it's Xiang Bei.

276
00:17:34,799 --> 00:17:36,319
Why did you help them lie to me?

277
00:17:37,079 --> 00:17:38,680
I swear, I'm innocent!

278
00:17:40,799 --> 00:17:42,960
Wei Tian only contacted Rosie and the Captain.

279
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:45,200
He never contacted me privately.

280
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:46,680
Even after I got back,

281
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,920
my dad never brought him up

282
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:48,759
in front of me.

283
00:17:48,799 --> 00:17:50,359
I was just as in the dark as you were.

284
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:52,039
Really.

285
00:17:52,319 --> 00:17:53,079
I mean it.

286
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,319
So please don't be mad, okay?

287
00:17:57,559 --> 00:17:59,519
What does my being mad have to do with you?

288
00:18:01,519 --> 00:18:02,319
Anda.

289
00:18:05,079 --> 00:18:05,880
You know

290
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:07,759
I've always cared about how you feel.

291
00:18:09,279 --> 00:18:10,680
Ac-Actually, you know

292
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,519
what I care about even more is...

293
00:18:14,559 --> 00:18:15,720
Mom, you're back.

294
00:18:15,799 --> 00:18:17,920
Look at me, I forgot my wallet.

295
00:18:18,599 --> 00:18:19,400
You two keep chatting.

296
00:18:19,400 --> 00:18:20,079
Auntie.

297
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,359
Um, I have some things to handle.

298
00:18:21,359 --> 00:18:22,319
I should get going.

299
00:18:22,319 --> 00:18:23,799
I already agreed with Anda

300
00:18:23,799 --> 00:18:25,000
to pick her up tomorrow morning.

301
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:28,559
You just got here.

302
00:18:28,559 --> 00:18:30,119
Why are you in such a rush to leave?

303
00:18:30,319 --> 00:18:31,079
I've got things to do.

304
00:18:32,799 --> 00:18:34,079
Drive safely on the way.

305
00:18:34,079 --> 00:18:34,720
Okay.

306
00:18:35,759 --> 00:18:37,920
Anda, I'll pick you up tomorrow morning, then.

307
00:18:42,079 --> 00:18:43,480
Auntie, I'll take my leave now.

308
00:18:43,519 --> 00:18:44,319
Okay.

309
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,279
This young man...

310
00:18:53,680 --> 00:18:54,799
He's handsome

311
00:18:55,279 --> 00:18:56,319
and so kind-hearted.

312
00:19:11,039 --> 00:19:11,799
Slow down.

313
00:19:11,799 --> 00:19:12,440
Okay.

314
00:19:13,319 --> 00:19:14,480
Be careful.

315
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,480
Keep a close watch.

316
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:18,400
All clear.

317
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:41,920
Do the employees like it here?

318
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:43,960
It's going well. They all like it.

319
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:49,519
Are they used to working and living here?

320
00:19:50,079 --> 00:19:51,039
Yes, they're well adjusted.

321
00:19:51,039 --> 00:19:52,519
They're very motivated at work, too.

322
00:19:54,359 --> 00:19:55,640
What's over there?

323
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:56,920
That's another base over there.

324
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:01,519
Good.

325
00:20:03,359 --> 00:20:04,680
Look, across that entire area,

326
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:06,000
construction has already begun.

327
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,799
About how long will it take to finish?

328
00:20:12,960 --> 00:20:14,880
We're pushing hard to stay on schedule.

329
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:15,920
It should be finished soon.

330
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:47,480
Who are you?

331
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:49,079
How did you know he was going to assassinate me?

332
00:20:49,079 --> 00:20:49,960
Greetings, Your Majesty.

333
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:52,440
I was sent by Zhong'an to handle your security.

334
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:53,240
My name is Wei Tian.

335
00:20:53,359 --> 00:20:54,160
Wei Tian.

336
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:56,720
You're with the Silent Protectors.

337
00:20:57,279 --> 00:20:58,079
Yes.

338
00:20:58,200 --> 00:20:59,880
In the future, I hope Your Majesty's schedule

339
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:01,319
can be shared with us in advance,

340
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:03,119
so we can be better prepared.

341
00:21:03,519 --> 00:21:04,319
All right.

342
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:06,839
I'll definitely let you know my upcoming schedule.

343
00:21:06,839 --> 00:21:07,720
Thank you, Your Majesty.

344
00:21:08,079 --> 00:21:09,319
Take this man away.

345
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:15,079
He's already dead.

346
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:18,200
Dead? That's letting him off too easy.

347
00:21:26,519 --> 00:21:27,319
Not bad.

348
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:28,920
You're just hungry.

349
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:31,319
I told you I'd take you out for a big meal,

350
00:21:31,319 --> 00:21:32,400
but you wouldn't wait.

351
00:21:32,759 --> 00:21:33,880
You insisted on eating here.

352
00:21:41,039 --> 00:21:41,839
Xiang Bei.

353
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:45,720
What is it?

354
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:52,799
Is Wei Tian doing all right in Antilocaris?

355
00:22:01,119 --> 00:22:02,119
Ever since I came back,

356
00:22:02,559 --> 00:22:04,319
I haven't had direct contact with him.

357
00:22:04,319 --> 00:22:06,759
Everything I heard was through my dad.

358
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:16,319
Anda, I...

359
00:22:17,319 --> 00:22:19,559
You might not want to hear this,

360
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:22,279
but as a friend,

361
00:22:22,839 --> 00:22:24,160
I... I have to tell you...

362
00:22:26,119 --> 00:22:27,799
You two are from different worlds.

363
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:29,960
You're not right for each other.

364
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:34,799
I... I didn't mean it like that.

365
00:22:34,799 --> 00:22:35,480
I mean...

366
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:37,720
Look...

367
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:41,000
I know Wei Tian has always been in your heart.

368
00:22:41,319 --> 00:22:42,119
But...

369
00:22:42,480 --> 00:22:44,319
hasn't he already made his choice?

370
00:22:45,039 --> 00:22:46,319
In his heart,

371
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:48,039
these feelings between you two

372
00:22:48,039 --> 00:22:49,359
are something he won't allow.

373
00:22:49,920 --> 00:22:50,720
Anda,

374
00:22:51,960 --> 00:22:53,400
I still hope

375
00:22:54,599 --> 00:22:56,759
you can give yourself another chance.

376
00:22:56,759 --> 00:22:57,519
Xiang Bei,

377
00:23:02,359 --> 00:23:03,160
I can't do that.

378
00:23:04,119 --> 00:23:04,839
In your heart,

379
00:23:04,839 --> 00:23:06,319
can you really not let him go?

380
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:10,000
That's right.

381
00:23:10,559 --> 00:23:12,039
I just can't let go of the past.

382
00:23:12,039 --> 00:23:13,359
I just can't let him go.

383
00:23:14,559 --> 00:23:17,720
Maybe someone else could bring me happiness now,

384
00:23:18,640 --> 00:23:22,720
but in my twenty-odd years of life,

385
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:26,519
what I went through with him in Antilocaris

386
00:23:26,599 --> 00:23:29,359
was truly the most unique and unforgettable.

387
00:23:31,079 --> 00:23:34,079
Even if I never see him again,

388
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:39,160
in my heart,

389
00:23:40,319 --> 00:23:41,720
there will always be a place for him.

390
00:23:49,359 --> 00:23:50,400
Over this period of time,

391
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:52,079
with everyone's tireless efforts,

392
00:23:52,079 --> 00:23:53,599
I believe you have all mastered

393
00:23:53,599 --> 00:23:55,400
some basic self-defense skills.

394
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,240
I hope that after this course ends,

395
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,279
none of you will slack off,

396
00:23:58,279 --> 00:24:00,319
and you'll keep up your good workout habits.

397
00:24:00,559 --> 00:24:01,720
Because this won't just make you

398
00:24:01,720 --> 00:24:02,680
grow stronger,

399
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:03,880
it also lets you be the first

400
00:24:03,880 --> 00:24:05,160
to enjoy

401
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:07,079
the fresh air and morning sunshine.

402
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:13,559
This session of our Women's Self-Defense class

403
00:24:13,559 --> 00:24:14,960
is now officially concluded.

404
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:17,079
I hope you've all learned something valuable.

405
00:24:17,599 --> 00:24:19,359
Let's give another warm round of applause

406
00:24:19,359 --> 00:24:21,680
to all the instructors here with us today.

407
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:23,079
Instructor Shen!

408
00:24:25,759 --> 00:24:27,599
I won't ever be afraid of bullies again!

409
00:24:28,240 --> 00:24:29,720
Totally! I'm in much better shape now too.

410
00:24:29,720 --> 00:24:30,920
Walking home at night after work,

411
00:24:30,920 --> 00:24:32,200
I don't have to be scared anymore.

412
00:24:32,599 --> 00:24:34,880
Instructor Anda, some of my best friends want to join.

413
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:36,559
When are you starting the next session?

414
00:24:37,279 --> 00:24:37,799
Yeah!

415
00:24:37,799 --> 00:24:39,119
We have friends who want to come too.

416
00:24:39,119 --> 00:24:40,359
Anda, we believe in you!

417
00:24:40,759 --> 00:24:41,480
Thank you all.

418
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:43,000
Thank you for supporting us.

419
00:24:43,079 --> 00:24:44,400
As long as you keep supporting us,

420
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:46,279
we'll definitely keep offering these classes.

421
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:49,079
I hope you'll continue to follow our updates.

422
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:52,519
By the way,

423
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:54,920
let's all take a group photo together!

424
00:24:55,000 --> 00:24:55,960
Awesome! Great idea!

425
00:25:02,400 --> 00:25:03,799
Dad, are you agreeing now

426
00:25:03,799 --> 00:25:05,200
to let Rosie and Captain help us?

427
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:09,599
You, Shen Yu, your Uncle Qu,

428
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:11,799
Rosie, and Zuo Feichen

429
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:14,720
must form a special ops team right away.

430
00:25:14,720 --> 00:25:15,880
What's so urgent?

431
00:25:16,559 --> 00:25:19,559
Our longtime client in Africa, Feng Ziwen,

432
00:25:20,279 --> 00:25:22,000
somehow managed to cross someone

433
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:22,960
in his business dealings over there.

434
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:24,519
Now he's here on a business trip,

435
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:26,200
and some people followed him,

436
00:25:26,519 --> 00:25:27,720
attempting to kidnap him.

437
00:25:28,400 --> 00:25:30,279
These people might be armed.

438
00:25:30,279 --> 00:25:31,119
It's very dangerous.

439
00:25:31,720 --> 00:25:32,759
Your mission

440
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:35,160
is to ensure his safety.

441
00:25:35,160 --> 00:25:36,720
Understood. We won't let you down!

442
00:25:36,759 --> 00:25:39,079
Remember, be extremely careful.

443
00:25:39,079 --> 00:25:39,720
Yes, sir.

444
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:42,799
Here's the briefing dossier.

445
00:25:44,519 --> 00:25:45,400
Look it over when you get back.

446
00:25:45,680 --> 00:25:47,160
Yes. Dad, I'll head out now.

447
00:25:49,440 --> 00:25:51,079
Our protection target this time

448
00:25:51,079 --> 00:25:52,559
is our old acquaintance, Feng Ziwen.

449
00:25:52,640 --> 00:25:54,680
He'll be leaving the city on a private plane.

450
00:25:54,880 --> 00:25:56,359
Our mission is to escort him

451
00:25:56,359 --> 00:25:58,119
from his private villa to the airport.

452
00:25:58,160 --> 00:25:59,759
Along the way, however, we could easily face

453
00:25:59,759 --> 00:26:01,119
an attack by hostile criminals.

454
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:02,400
We must remain extremely alert.

455
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:02,920
Once at the airport,

456
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:04,680
a dedicated detail will take over his security.

457
00:26:05,160 --> 00:26:06,599
To ensure absolute secrecy,

458
00:26:06,599 --> 00:26:08,680
someone from the Feng Group will contact him specifically.

459
00:26:08,799 --> 00:26:10,759
That means when he leaves the villa,

460
00:26:10,759 --> 00:26:12,319
he won't be carrying any luggage,

461
00:26:12,319 --> 00:26:13,839
and no one will be accompanying him.

462
00:26:13,839 --> 00:26:14,920
Right now, Rosie and Captain

463
00:26:14,920 --> 00:26:16,160
are already waiting downstairs.

464
00:26:16,160 --> 00:26:17,079
Let's move out immediately.

465
00:26:18,599 --> 00:26:19,079
Copy that.

466
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:37,279
Uncle Qu,

467
00:26:37,519 --> 00:26:38,319
get in.

468
00:26:46,039 --> 00:26:47,119
We'll take the same car.

469
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:48,279
Once we get to the villa,

470
00:26:48,279 --> 00:26:50,079
Rosie and I will look for Feng Ziwen's car.

471
00:27:29,880 --> 00:27:31,000
We meet again.

472
00:27:31,000 --> 00:27:32,559
President Feng, please get in our car.

473
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:33,519
All right.

474
00:28:27,160 --> 00:28:28,519
We're in big trouble.

475
00:28:29,200 --> 00:28:30,000
Hurry!

476
00:29:20,319 --> 00:29:20,720
Is everyone okay?

477
00:29:20,720 --> 00:29:21,079
We're fine.

478
00:29:21,079 --> 00:29:23,200
Xiang Bei, escort Mr. Feng to the airport first.

479
00:29:23,200 --> 00:29:24,960
We'll take care of these guys.

480
00:29:24,960 --> 00:29:25,720
Got it.

481
00:29:32,599 --> 00:29:33,319
Mr. Feng,

482
00:29:33,319 --> 00:29:34,799
your flight is about to take off.

483
00:29:34,839 --> 00:29:35,640
Okay.

484
00:29:36,039 --> 00:29:37,519
Mr. Feng is safe now.

485
00:29:38,319 --> 00:29:39,119
Xiang Bei.

486
00:29:43,079 --> 00:29:44,000
Thank you all.

487
00:29:44,839 --> 00:29:45,640
Get going.

488
00:29:46,240 --> 00:29:47,039
Take care.

489
00:30:13,359 --> 00:30:14,880
It's time to end this.

490
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:19,319
First, we'll send a small unit

491
00:30:19,319 --> 00:30:20,799
to set up an ambush here,

492
00:30:21,640 --> 00:30:24,599
then strike from here with our main force.

493
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:26,279
Once the appointed time arrives...

494
00:30:26,279 --> 00:30:27,000
Sir, hear me out.

495
00:30:29,039 --> 00:30:31,160
Phase Two of the pipeline has just begun.

496
00:30:31,559 --> 00:30:33,279
Why don't we launch a surprise attack

497
00:30:33,279 --> 00:30:35,319
and derail their plans once and for all?

498
00:30:35,880 --> 00:30:36,920
As you know,

499
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:38,480
once the pipeline is completed,

500
00:30:38,680 --> 00:30:40,920
it'll only allow Jose Limon's anti-drug policy

501
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:42,519
to be enforced even more thoroughly.

502
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:44,480
That does us no good.

503
00:30:45,319 --> 00:30:46,359
It seems you also think

504
00:30:46,359 --> 00:30:48,480
it's time for us to take the initiative.

505
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:49,920
Precisely, sir.

506
00:30:50,720 --> 00:30:51,799
Right now, inside the palace,

507
00:30:51,799 --> 00:30:53,599
our operatives are planted everywhere.

508
00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:54,920
Just say the word,

509
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:57,319
and the royal palace will be ours.

510
00:30:58,319 --> 00:31:00,000
Then what are you waiting for?

511
00:31:00,200 --> 00:31:01,119
Make your move.

512
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:36,759
Right here,

513
00:31:37,319 --> 00:31:39,400
on behalf of the people of Supedo, I declare

514
00:31:40,240 --> 00:31:43,000
that King Jose Limon has betrayed

515
00:31:43,079 --> 00:31:45,799
the founding oath of the Kingdom of Supedo.

516
00:31:45,920 --> 00:31:47,920
His policies and reforms

517
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:49,559
have severely violated

518
00:31:49,839 --> 00:31:51,559
the common interests of the people of Supedo.

519
00:31:51,559 --> 00:31:54,319
We will immediately arrest King Jose Limon

520
00:31:54,319 --> 00:31:56,400
and make him fully confess

521
00:31:56,400 --> 00:31:57,480
to all of his crimes,

522
00:31:57,920 --> 00:32:00,960
giving the entire nation a proper reckoning.

523
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:04,400
This is the shared voice of the people of Supedo.

524
00:32:04,839 --> 00:32:07,079
We will bring him to justice.

525
00:32:29,039 --> 00:32:31,279
Zhong'an, Wei Tian

526
00:32:49,839 --> 00:32:50,920
What brings you here, Anda?

527
00:32:58,000 --> 00:32:58,799
Anda.

528
00:33:00,319 --> 00:33:01,119
Rosie.

529
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:03,799
On suspicion of aiding King Jose Limon

530
00:33:03,799 --> 00:33:05,480
in violating the constitution and colluding with the enemy,

531
00:33:05,559 --> 00:33:07,799
police have searched the offices of

532
00:33:07,799 --> 00:33:10,160
the Chinese security firm Zhong'an Group.

533
00:33:10,880 --> 00:33:11,680
The Chinese side

534
00:33:11,680 --> 00:33:13,920
has lodged a stern protest against this.

535
00:33:14,200 --> 00:33:17,039
The parties involved declined to comment.

536
00:33:17,039 --> 00:33:18,640
For detailed coverage on this matter,

537
00:33:18,640 --> 00:33:20,079
stay tuned to our broadcast

538
00:33:20,079 --> 00:33:22,480
for further reports from our correspondent in China.

539
00:33:24,799 --> 00:33:25,880
Don't worry just yet, Anda.

540
00:33:29,640 --> 00:33:32,480
Have you... Have you heard any news?

541
00:33:33,279 --> 00:33:35,720
Look, we've been calling non-stop,

542
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:37,480
but we can't get through.

543
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:40,359
We've sent several emails,

544
00:33:40,359 --> 00:33:41,519
but there's no reply yet.

545
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:43,960
Once he's free,

546
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:45,400
he might get back to us.

547
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:46,480
Don't worry for now.

548
00:33:46,480 --> 00:33:47,319
Right.

549
00:33:47,319 --> 00:33:48,720
The reception has always been bad there.

550
00:33:48,920 --> 00:33:49,680
So for the time being,

551
00:33:49,680 --> 00:33:50,960
it's normal not to reach him.

552
00:33:52,279 --> 00:33:54,559
Maybe he went out without his phone.

553
00:33:55,640 --> 00:33:57,400
Why would I be worried?

554
00:33:57,839 --> 00:33:58,880
To him,

555
00:33:59,039 --> 00:34:00,000
I've always been

556
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:01,599
an outsider in his world.

557
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:04,359
Whether he's now with the Silent Protectors

558
00:34:04,680 --> 00:34:06,599
or a security officer at Zhong'an.

559
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:09,719
Never mind that.

560
00:34:09,719 --> 00:34:11,920
Since you haven't heard anything,

561
00:34:11,920 --> 00:34:12,760
and it's getting late,

562
00:34:12,760 --> 00:34:14,119
I'll take my leave.

563
00:34:29,239 --> 00:34:30,039
Anda.

564
00:34:31,880 --> 00:34:34,079
Mom made your favorite curry fish balls.

565
00:34:34,519 --> 00:34:35,719
Come on, get up and eat.

566
00:34:37,920 --> 00:34:38,679
Anda.

567
00:34:46,920 --> 00:34:48,159
Time to eat.

568
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:50,000
I made a whole table of delicious food.

569
00:34:58,039 --> 00:34:58,840
Anda.

570
00:34:59,639 --> 00:35:01,199
Come eat once you're awake.

571
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:35,400
If all else fails, we'll just head straight over there.

572
00:35:35,400 --> 00:35:37,159
I have a bad feeling something's going down.

573
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:39,599
Take it easy.

574
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:41,519
I've been thinking...

575
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:45,000
The King of Supedo was taken hostage,

576
00:35:45,719 --> 00:35:47,480
so why did Wei Tian disappear?

577
00:35:49,480 --> 00:35:50,280
Look.

578
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:52,079
The Phase Two pipeline project

579
00:35:52,079 --> 00:35:53,480
was going very smoothly.

580
00:35:53,840 --> 00:35:56,480
As Zhong'an's security officer,

581
00:35:56,599 --> 00:35:58,599
Wei Tian must be involved in this.

582
00:36:00,440 --> 00:36:03,000
The terrorists took the King of Supedo hostage

583
00:36:04,199 --> 00:36:07,480
to take control of the Phase Two pipeline.

584
00:36:08,239 --> 00:36:08,840
No.

585
00:36:08,840 --> 00:36:10,679
The king must have...

586
00:36:10,679 --> 00:36:11,960
because of the Phase Two pipeline,

587
00:36:12,159 --> 00:36:14,199
stepped on someone's toes.

588
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:21,960
Wei Tian sent an email.

589
00:36:25,400 --> 00:36:27,159
Terrorists have seized the palace.

590
00:36:28,519 --> 00:36:30,599
King Jose Limon is missing.

591
00:36:30,920 --> 00:36:32,639
Doing everything to locate the king.

592
00:36:32,639 --> 00:36:33,679
For security reasons,

593
00:36:34,679 --> 00:36:36,320
he's cutting contact with us.

594
00:36:38,119 --> 00:36:40,880
He's always such a lone wolf.

595
00:36:40,880 --> 00:36:42,760
Same old habit, I tell you.

596
00:36:42,840 --> 00:36:45,159
No way. I'm emailing him right back.

597
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:47,360
He has to check in with us regularly.

598
00:36:47,880 --> 00:36:49,400
If he wants to go solo,

599
00:36:50,760 --> 00:36:52,159
we'll rush right back

600
00:36:52,159 --> 00:36:53,920
and dig him out even if we turn the place upside down.

601
00:36:58,960 --> 00:37:00,800
The problem is, it's too dangerous for him alone.

602
00:37:02,480 --> 00:37:03,559
He's always like this.

603
00:37:15,360 --> 00:37:18,119
Uncle Qu, how's Wei Tian doing?

604
00:37:19,440 --> 00:37:20,719
How are things on your end?

605
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:22,159
I plan to ask my dad

606
00:37:22,159 --> 00:37:23,079
to end the assessment early

607
00:37:23,079 --> 00:37:24,519
and report back to Antilocaris.

608
00:37:24,679 --> 00:37:25,559
Why the rush?

609
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:27,679
Did you hear something?

610
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:29,079
From our Zhong'an Africa branch,

611
00:37:29,079 --> 00:37:30,159
Helen told me that

612
00:37:30,280 --> 00:37:31,320
Jose Limon might have already

613
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:32,679
been taken hostage by terrorists.

614
00:37:32,880 --> 00:37:34,840
If the Phase Two pipeline project is affected,

615
00:37:34,840 --> 00:37:36,480
Zhong'an will be the first to suffer.

616
00:37:36,559 --> 00:37:38,159
All right, all right, I got it.

617
00:37:38,159 --> 00:37:38,920
Okay.

618
00:37:51,360 --> 00:37:52,400
What are you doing here?

619
00:37:52,920 --> 00:37:54,480
Would you believe me if I said I was just passing by?

620
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:56,719
I...

621
00:37:56,800 --> 00:37:58,079
It's okay, I already know everything.

622
00:37:59,239 --> 00:38:01,000
Just focus on your work at the hotel.

623
00:38:01,159 --> 00:38:02,559
I already spoke with my dad.

624
00:38:02,559 --> 00:38:03,920
As for the training center,

625
00:38:04,039 --> 00:38:05,480
there'll always be a place kept for you.

626
00:38:05,519 --> 00:38:07,079
You can come back whenever you want.

627
00:38:07,840 --> 00:38:09,679
How about I give you a ride home?

628
00:38:09,760 --> 00:38:11,079
That's all right, I can walk.

629
00:38:11,480 --> 00:38:12,280
No problem.

630
00:38:12,760 --> 00:38:13,559
Besides,

631
00:38:13,559 --> 00:38:15,920
I want to get some fresh air and clear my head anyway.

632
00:38:17,480 --> 00:38:19,119
Are you in a bad mood?

633
00:38:20,119 --> 00:38:21,800
I brought up going back to Africa with my dad.

634
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:22,679
He turned me down.

635
00:38:24,320 --> 00:38:25,119
Africa?

636
00:38:25,960 --> 00:38:28,320
Is there any news about Wei Tian?

637
00:38:29,360 --> 00:38:31,559
To be exact, the whole of Supedo

638
00:38:31,559 --> 00:38:32,679
is currently in turmoil.

639
00:38:33,159 --> 00:38:34,360
Zhong'an's position over there

640
00:38:34,360 --> 00:38:35,280
is very awkward.

641
00:38:37,039 --> 00:38:38,480
Don't worry, Wei Tian is fine.

642
00:38:39,239 --> 00:38:40,559
You don't need to comfort me.

643
00:38:41,119 --> 00:38:43,159
I've already made up my mind.

644
00:38:43,840 --> 00:38:45,119
I'm going back to Antilocaris.

645
00:38:46,199 --> 00:38:47,079
You're going back?

646
00:38:50,119 --> 00:38:54,320
I just can't walk away from everything there.

647
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:57,719
Looks like I'll have to go back, too.

648
00:38:58,920 --> 00:38:59,880
Zhong'an needs me.

649
00:38:59,880 --> 00:39:00,960
And so do you and Wei Tian.

650
00:39:03,760 --> 00:39:05,480
Didn't your dad say no?

651
00:39:06,599 --> 00:39:08,079
It's fine, he's my dad.

652
00:39:08,960 --> 00:39:11,480
Worst-case scenario, I'll just throw a huge fit.

653
00:39:16,519 --> 00:39:18,360
Right now, Antilocaris

654
00:39:18,519 --> 00:39:20,239
is crawling with militants.

655
00:39:20,239 --> 00:39:22,480
This is no ordinary terrorist attack.

656
00:39:23,599 --> 00:39:25,960
Right. All of Antilocaris

657
00:39:26,480 --> 00:39:28,800
has fallen under Hades's control.

658
00:39:29,039 --> 00:39:30,760
He keeps sending men to hunt me down.

659
00:39:31,639 --> 00:39:33,960
What on earth does this Hades want?

660
00:39:34,920 --> 00:39:36,679
What matters most to Hades is money.

661
00:39:37,039 --> 00:39:38,679
Second is me.

662
00:39:39,559 --> 00:39:41,239
Then we'll head back right now to help you.

663
00:39:41,239 --> 00:39:42,000
Listen to me.

664
00:39:42,599 --> 00:39:44,199
King Jose Limon

665
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:47,320
is rumored to have fled to Libania.

666
00:39:47,360 --> 00:39:50,559
I need you to assign personnel to protect him.

667
00:39:51,119 --> 00:39:51,920
What about you?

668
00:39:52,239 --> 00:39:53,480
Zhonggang has become

669
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:55,079
the contractor for Phase Two of the pipeline.

670
00:39:55,679 --> 00:39:57,719
I promised Zhong'an I would help them out.

671
00:39:58,280 --> 00:39:59,079
So,

672
00:39:59,960 --> 00:40:02,159
I must finish things up here first.

673
00:40:03,199 --> 00:40:04,760
All right. Once we finish investigating,

674
00:40:04,760 --> 00:40:06,199
we'll meet up with you as soon as possible.

675
00:40:06,599 --> 00:40:07,400
Okay.

676
00:40:08,239 --> 00:40:09,800
Once I get a new phone number

677
00:40:10,960 --> 00:40:12,360
that isn't being tapped,

678
00:40:12,679 --> 00:40:13,760
I'll let you know.

679
00:40:14,119 --> 00:40:15,079
You take care, too.

680
00:40:28,960 --> 00:40:29,800
I think

681
00:40:29,840 --> 00:40:31,639
Wei Tian is intentionally pushing us away.

682
00:40:31,639 --> 00:40:32,800
He wants to act alone.

683
00:40:33,920 --> 00:40:37,159
You mean Jose Limon isn't in Libania?

684
00:40:38,000 --> 00:40:39,320
What if it's true?

685
00:40:39,559 --> 00:40:41,840
So you head to Libania,

686
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:43,679
and I'll go to Antilocaris.

687
00:40:44,199 --> 00:40:45,079
Don't argue with me.

688
00:40:45,559 --> 00:40:46,920
I can already sense it.

689
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:48,719
He's in grave danger over there.

690
00:40:48,719 --> 00:40:50,119
We have to go back.

691
00:40:50,519 --> 00:40:52,800
Besides, the neighboring country you're going to

692
00:40:52,800 --> 00:40:54,000
isn't very safe either.

693
00:40:54,119 --> 00:40:55,440
Your mission there

694
00:40:55,440 --> 00:40:56,599
could be quite dangerous too.

695
00:40:56,599 --> 00:40:57,920
So take good care of yourself.

696
00:40:58,039 --> 00:41:01,199
Let's bid farewell to President Xiang tomorrow.

697
00:41:02,320 --> 00:41:03,079
Okay.

698
00:41:03,280 --> 00:41:04,320
Have you really thought it through?

699
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:09,360
Antilocaris is a place

700
00:41:09,559 --> 00:41:10,960
everyone wants to escape from.

701
00:41:11,280 --> 00:41:12,159
Look at you.

702
00:41:12,679 --> 00:41:14,119
You finally managed to get out,

703
00:41:14,119 --> 00:41:15,320
yet you're rushing right back.

704
00:41:16,639 --> 00:41:17,599
Isn't this great?

705
00:41:18,840 --> 00:41:20,000
Someone else gets to come back instead,

706
00:41:20,079 --> 00:41:21,159
and he'll owe me a favor.

707
00:41:24,639 --> 00:41:27,480
Anda, I've been there before.

708
00:41:27,639 --> 00:41:28,920
I know what it's like.

709
00:41:29,840 --> 00:41:31,079
So I just want to ask you,

710
00:41:31,480 --> 00:41:33,880
is it really worth it for Wei Tian?

711
00:41:37,039 --> 00:41:38,119
Deep down, I know

712
00:41:38,440 --> 00:41:39,800
that even if I go back,

713
00:41:39,800 --> 00:41:41,360
I won't be able to help him much.

714
00:41:42,079 --> 00:41:44,719
But being closer to him

715
00:41:44,719 --> 00:41:45,920
gives me peace of mind.

716
00:41:47,559 --> 00:41:49,079
You silly girl.

717
00:41:52,039 --> 00:41:53,079
Why so suddenly?

718
00:41:58,760 --> 00:42:01,760
The situation there is critical right now.

719
00:42:02,440 --> 00:42:05,159
Wei Tian is in extreme danger.

720
00:42:05,800 --> 00:42:07,760
He has no fixed place to stay,

721
00:42:07,840 --> 00:42:09,800
constantly running from pursuers all day.

722
00:42:10,079 --> 00:42:12,559
And right now, we can only reach him

723
00:42:13,119 --> 00:42:14,480
at scheduled times and locations.

724
00:42:16,360 --> 00:42:17,519
Ten minutes a day.

725
00:42:18,039 --> 00:42:19,920
We can only contact him for ten minutes a day.

726
00:42:23,159 --> 00:42:24,719
He's fighting alone,

727
00:42:25,199 --> 00:42:28,719
and the terrorists have heavy firepower.

728
00:42:28,840 --> 00:42:30,599
I'm worried that if we're a day late,

729
00:42:31,239 --> 00:42:32,039
he might...

730
00:42:36,880 --> 00:42:39,559
Should we try convincing him to return home?

731
00:42:40,280 --> 00:42:43,960
No, he has a special mission there.

732
00:42:43,960 --> 00:42:44,960
A special mission?

733
00:42:45,400 --> 00:42:48,079
I can't disclose that.

734
00:42:51,400 --> 00:42:52,719
You can't even tell me?

735
00:42:59,280 --> 00:43:00,079
Alright.

736
00:43:01,400 --> 00:43:03,199
Since you've made up your minds,

737
00:43:05,760 --> 00:43:07,199
I won't hold you back.

738
00:43:07,639 --> 00:43:10,159
I'll call Zhong'an's Africa branch

739
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:13,519
and have them assist you with everything they have.

740
00:43:14,159 --> 00:43:15,079
Once you arrive,

741
00:43:15,079 --> 00:43:16,400
get in touch with them right away.

742
00:43:17,000 --> 00:43:19,719
Don't hesitate to tell them if you need anything.

743
00:43:20,639 --> 00:43:21,440
Thank you.

744
00:43:21,880 --> 00:43:22,960
Understood, thank you.

745
00:43:24,039 --> 00:43:26,159
By the way, there's one more thing.

746
00:43:27,880 --> 00:43:29,599
Xiao Bei came to see me last night.

747
00:43:29,760 --> 00:43:31,719
He wants to return to Africa with us,

748
00:43:31,760 --> 00:43:33,119
and wanted your opinion.

749
00:43:34,079 --> 00:43:34,920
Nonsense!
